items.ARD_Wayfinder_Compass.name = Wayfinder's Hearth Compass
items.ARD_Wayfinder_Compass.description = Oak rings and peened copper surround a white sight-stone. The rim carries a trail notch for every traveler brought home, remembering the Emerald Wilds wardens and their quiet paths. Two answering markers honor the Twinwardens. A hearth keeps its own direction: home.
items.ARD_Last_Watch_Standard.name = Last Watch Sun Standard
items.ARD_Last_Watch_Standard.description = A sand-wrapped watch standard holds a brass sun above a weathered oath-mark. Its frayed lower edge recalls the Dunewatch banners swallowed by the dunes while the watchposts kept their promise. Beneath the buried road, the oath endures.
items.ARD_Whisperfrost_Lantern.name = Whisperfrost Vigil Lantern
items.ARD_Whisperfrost_Lantern.description = Silver tracery braces a pale crystal inside cold-worked cobalt. The lantern remembers the Whisperfrost patterns kept beside the hearth, ready when the white fields moved. Its still crystal keeps the shape of a winter vigil.
items.ARD_Epitaph_Reliquary.name = Epitaph Reliquary
items.ARD_Epitaph_Reliquary.description = A violet reliquary key hangs beneath a bone-bound epitaph. Its last line and two violet confession reliquaries remain unfinished, remembering the names below Mournhollow and the paired Last Rites. There is still room for the living to return.
items.ARD_Deepworks_Heart.name = Requiem Engine Reliquary
items.ARD_Deepworks_Heart.description = Battered iron ribs and cyan rails cradle an amber engine-heart. This small reliquary remembers the Gobliterator's wreck, the smiths who listened to its stubborn rhythm and the Requiem's last hymn. Its furnace is a painted memory of machinery that refused to stop.
items.ARD_Firstlight_Orrery.name = Firstlight Seal Orrery
items.ARD_Firstlight_Orrery.description = Three broken white-gold seals gather around a violet star above a cyan lens. Paired lower prisms remember Vesper and Vigil: one keeping the fading light, one keeping watch beneath an unfinished dawn. This orrery preserves Luminia's vigil in a circle of still light.
items.ARD_Unblinking_Shrine.name = Unblinking Eye Shrine
items.ARD_Unblinking_Shrine.description = A silver prayer-skull rests below a violet eye in an arched cage. Red oath-marks sit in dark recesses beneath the altar plates, recalling the Nameless God's covenant whose maker left no name. The eye remains, and the chamber keeps its silence.
items.ARD_Threadkeeper_Maze.name = Threadkeeper's Maze
items.ARD_Threadkeeper_Maze.description = Chrome ribs frame a black maze crossed by a single cyan thread. The line is deliberately left open at its last turn, remembering the Labyrinth artificers' invitation to find the next way through. The path belongs to whoever follows.
items.ARD_Windward_Mobile.name = Windward Promise Sky-Chart
items.ARD_Windward_Mobile.description = Darkwood and red bindings frame a sky-chart of brass and blue steel. An old green wind-carving watches over its distant routes, remembering the wandering trader and Airshop couriers who kept one promise above the clouds. Every route leaves a little room for home.
items.ARD_Goliath_Trophy.name = Iron Colossus Heart Trophy
items.ARD_Goliath_Trophy.description = Fortress shoulders rise around an amber furnace-heart, joined by a heavy piston spine. The effigy honors the Iron Colossus epithet carried by Deepworks Goliath .50 and its deliberate siege cadence. Here, the machine's strength is held in the shape of a monument.
items.ARD_Rampart_Trophy.name = Last Bastion Governor Trophy
items.ARD_Rampart_Trophy.description = A braced flywheel and swept solar vanes shelter a yellow focus above a sand-cloth oath panel. This trophy remembers the Oath of the Last Bastion carried by Dunewatch Rampart SAW: a watch maintained through dust, heat and the weight of an unbroken promise.
